\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] DARPA DSO, Mathematical Challenges, BAA 07-68 (catalogue attribution: 2007), Challenge 005. Historical source mirror; unavailable in this check.
\url{https://web.math.utk.edu/~vasili/refs/darpa07.MathChallenges.html}.
